WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.701
[MUSIC]

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:06.062
Good afternoon.

00:00:06.062 --> 00:00:08.882
Welcome back.

00:00:08.882 --> 00:00:12.062
