00:00:12.062 --> 00:00:13.410
Yeah?

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:14.390
Thank you, thank you.

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:17.058
Would you, I know you just got settled,

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:20.710
would you all just stand up and
