00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:21.666
Any seat but the one you're in.

00:00:41.287 --> 00:00:41.827
Perfect.

00:00:59.151 --> 00:01:00.031
&gt;&gt; Oh, perfect.

00:01:03.331 --> 00:01:05.371
Thank you very much.

00:01:05.371 --> 00:01:08.411
I didn't see any fights, so that was good.

00:01:08.411 --> 00:01:11.670
And you all successful at it,
of course we're at Stanford.

