00:32:04.090 --> 00:32:06.020
And reacquire it as many times.

00:32:06.020 --> 00:32:08.545
Just break and release and
break and release your eye contact.

00:32:08.545 --> 00:32:10.516
You can move your eyes.

00:32:10.516 --> 00:32:11.930
