00:33:20.710 --> 00:33:21.540
Great nice.

00:33:23.000 --> 00:33:24.520
So interesting to watch.

00:33:26.490 --> 00:33:27.800
There's something here right?

00:33:28.890 --> 00:33:29.630
Yeah.

00:33:29.630 --> 00:33:32.160
So switch behaviors.

00:33:32.160 --> 00:33:34.370
Whatever you just did, do the opposite.

00:33:34.370 --> 00:33:35.780
If you were looking, look away.

00:33:35.780 --> 00:33:39.390
You're just going to look and hold
comfortable, don't go psychotic on us.

