00:35:11.820 --> 00:35:15.060
Eye contact, turns out,
means a lot to us, and

00:35:15.060 --> 00:35:19.480
that's a pretty extreme version of it,
to just look, and hold.

00:35:19.480 --> 00:35:20.770
It's a pretty extreme.

00:35:20.770 --> 00:35:23.556
There's a point where it gets,
