themselves to not blink at all.

00:35:33.170 --> 00:35:35.120
Clint Eastwood never blinks.

00:35:35.120 --> 00:35:37.720
And his characters tend
to be very powerful.

00:35:37.720 --> 00:35:39.440
That's part of this.

00:35:39.440 --> 00:35:45.270
So this equation of looking and holding,
we would call that high status.

00:35:45.270 --> 00:35:49.830
If we drift a little from the social
science into the theater world,

00:35:49.830 --> 00:35:51.920
we would call it high status.

00:35:51.920 --> 00:35:55.200
And that is being more authoritative,
more powerful.

00:35:56.390 --> 00:35:59.620
The looking and
looking away would be more approachable.

00:35:59.620 --> 00:36:06.666
So it's authoritative versus approachable,
is the scale I think we're playing with.

