00:38:07.440 --> 00:38:09.330
And there are people on both sides,

00:38:09.330 --> 00:38:14.340
of all of the possible aisles that you
could think of, that it's true for.

00:38:14.340 --> 00:38:17.530
But it's why we do see people
coming from Hollywood and

00:38:17.530 --> 00:38:20.430
actors that end up doing quite well.

00:38:20.430 --> 00:38:22.820
Because they are really
good at this equation.

00:38:24.330 --> 00:38:29.120
So, okay, it is not what you say,
it is how you say it.

00:38:29.120 --> 00:38:30.430
